OL,3,GNEWSAPlan aims to improve support for  
OL,4,Apeople with autism                     
OL,6,FPlans have been announced to ensure    
OL,7,Fpeople with autism in Guernsey get     
OL,8,Ftimely and effective support and       
OL,9,Fawareness of the condition improves.   
OL,11,FThe States' Autism Framework sets out a
OL,12,Fplan for the next five years based on  
OL,13,Fthe results of a 2025 survey of people 
OL,14,Fwith autism and their families as well 
OL,15,Fas discussions with carers and other   
OL,16,Fprofessionals.                         
OL,18,FIt includes key priorities for         
OL,19,Fimproving access to support and        
OL,20,Fremoving barriers to inclusion.        
