OL,3,GNEWSAPlan aims to improve support for  
OL,4,Apeople with autism                     
OL,6,FStephen Parker, associate director of  
OL,7,Fmental health, said the aim was that   
OL,8,F"people should get the right support at
OL,9,Fthe right time", adding: "There is good
OL,10,Fpractice to build on, and there are    
OL,11,Falso areas where things need to        
OL,12,Fimprove."                              
